Z||000018||DaRkLoRD||08-27-2001||06:07 PM||||**disclaimer**<BR>as far as I know, I've never seen an alien spacecraft. However, I have seen what I believe to be a classified military aircraft, a large black triangle-shaped craft with a light at each vertex and another in the center, when I was in Florida several years ago. It made virtually no sound, and was faster than any jet I've ever seen. It was low enough (or big enough......) that I was able to make out some details (light placement) so it wasn't a sattelite or anything.<P>that being said... I am 100% convinced that extraterrestrials are real, are visiting us, and that all the major world governments are aware of this, and most are probably in contact with these beings. I also believe that most encounters are covered up by the military, and if that's not possible, then disinformation is used to discredit the sighting/encounter. and all the liars and nutcases who claim to have seen things, but actually haven't, only makes the problem worse. I've seen many documentaries on this subject, also read many books, and talked with many people who have witnessed UFOs, or government coverups of some sort or another.<P>I'd love to talk about this in more detail, if anyone wants to share stories etc, email me! Of particular interest to me is encounters with airplanes, and the base at Dulce NM..<P>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@digitalfusion.on.ca">steve@digitalfusion.on.ca</A>  <P>------------------<BR>     <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>     <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A><p>[This message has been edited by DaRkLoRD (edited 08-27-2001).]||||reg||3
