Z||000022||Ken Wittlief||08-28-2001||11:39 AM||||I think one of the more interesting explanations for UFO and alien abductions is that they are spiritual beings, not physical ones.<P> most people that report being abducted say they were asleep at the time<P> most UFO reports give accounts that defy the laws of physics - so what is a bigger leap of logic:  these are physical objects that defy the laws of physics, or these encounters are spiritual in nature? <P> there have been UFO encounters where some people see the event, and people standing right next to them see nothing - I think that supports the spiritual explaination.<P>Throughout human history people have encountered supernatural things  - in the past they represented themselves as gods, angles, or humans that have died and crossed over.<P> now that technology is the core of human nature they are representing themselves as aliens from other planets.<P> Are they the same entities that mankind has had encounters with all along? In the old testiment account of Noah and the flood, it says that fallen angels had taken human women and had offspring with them, creating a halfbreed super human - which was part of the reason for the flood - to wipe this altered race of half human creatures out. The literal translation says that Noah and his immediate family were the only ones left on the planet whos gene pool had not been corrupted by this interbreeding with the fallen angels.<P>  And now here we are again, only now they are aliens, and what is the central focus of alien abductions? They are interested in creating offspring that are half human, half alien.<P>  The more things change...||||reg||10
