Z||000098||starfighter007@msn.com||08-30-2001||04:29 PM||||HEY fellers !just got back from that Dam site  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> Oh before I forget I'm sure that most of us here saw the movie contact .There is some one in here that reminds of someone that was in that movie  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_watchout.gif"> Hmmm..maybe not.<P>Ok I went to the dam sTayed in my car cause there was no where to park close to the dam.I will go out and get poloroid camera this afternoo and some film and well let me finish first explaining what I saw.Like I said there was no place to park the car no parking signs around the dam .I could see some I guess you can call odd things there maybe not odd .there is what appears to to be some white shack that sits on top of the dam on the edge maybe 10'x15'there were some antennas sticking out of the roof Oh btw the road is about 200feet from the dam.I did not see any windows in the building from my vantage point.Now there is a opening at the bottom of the dam and it is framed in concrete The only reason I saw this opening is because Roger pointed it out yesturday.I had to really look for sure enough there it is  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"> Now I know edsb 52was there earlier this week  and ill bet that he did not notice this opening Ed let us know if you noticed it .ok there is what i would describe a livestock fence that goes around the perimeter of the dam with your usual no trespassing signs on it nothing real threatning like death or anything but if you get caught $1000.00 fine and or 6 months imprisoment Well I know Ed said that he felt a strange feeling come over him while he was there Ill tell you I got hit with a stange feeling like move along I dont know if it was the signs that make you feel that way or what but I had a uneasy feeling come over me .now If I go there to take picures I dont think I want to do that alone I would hope that maybe Steve Normington  and Ed could meet me there sometime in the next week or so The reason is this may sound stupid but I now am alittle more than nervous about taking pictures there by my self.so How bout guys? <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> Oh and Roger thanks <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> ||||reg||1
